# Calculator, Edit > Paste in the scientific view: ":s1\2\3\4\:d" (Sta opens the statistics box,
# Dat adds 1 to 4, s), then the box's LOAD, CD and RET buttons by their mnemonics, 5 added with Ins
# (Dat) and the text pasted again
# Reference run only (the port side is calc-paste4.w16, which puts the text on the clipboard with
# "clip"): Program Manager is the shell and WIN.INI run=calc.exe notepad.exe; Notepad opens
# SYSTEM\cp4.txt (holding the text), selects and copies it and closes, then Calculator pastes.
shot
key alt
type fo
shot
type system\cp4.txt
key enter
shot
key alt
type ea
key alt
type ec
key alt
type fx
shot
key alt
type vs
shot
key alt
type ep
shot
type l
shot
type c
shot
type r
shot
type 5
key insert
shot
key alt
type ep
